From 92ca07783bd5b981a8c7cc2b94afca78310e553f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:22:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 23/28] Rebuild the host-admission bundle for the composed
 lease reader

scripts/build-host-admission.mjs, unchanged settings: network/lease-reader.mjs, an input of the bundle, changed with
A's 25c051a95..e820e240 applied on fad657bc (b7f88a862 here: "Close the verified LeaseReader client's
metadata methods with its operation"), so --check failed
before and passes after.
- windows/node/host-admission.bundle.mjs 2dba0ceb -> efaf6fdb (the supervisor's and the Windows node's shared bundle)
- metal/guest/host-policy.bundle.mjs 9a6aa25a and the metal lease-gas conduit bundle 421d6584 stayed current.
The other bundles whose --check already failed at fad657bc (Windows lease runtime, MCP and platform API guest bundles,
host-service packages; see 714aa0dcd) are still not rebuilt here: the final composition rebuilds them in its order.
---
 windows/node/host-admission.bundle.mjs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/windows/node/host-admission.bundle.mjs b/windows/node/host-admission.bundle.mjs
index 37311dbdfd190ab83f73fbffc47460ad28cb755d..6b9f135695df799844595f63ebda6bbf6b512cef 100644
